 967:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/object/ai.c ****                    for a minimum period of time, specified in the Time_Delay property, and
 968:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/object/ai.c ****                    (b) the HighLimitEnable flag must be set in the Limit_Enable property, and
